{"title":"Career Roadmap · Technology Transfer Officer","role":"Technology Transfer Officer","summary":"A Technology Transfer Officer (TTO) helps move research discoveries, inventions and intellectual property from universities, research institutions or laboratories into practical commercial or societal applications.","facts":{"Current degree":"Law - LLB / BA LLB / BBA LLB / B.Com LLB / B.Sc LLB (Integrated)","Course":"Intellectual Property Law"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Technology Transfer Officer (TTO) helps move research discoveries, inventions and intellectual property from universities, research institutions or laboratories into practical commercial or societal applications."},{"type":"p","text":"The role sits at the intersection of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Intellectual property law"},{"text":"Research and innovation"},{"text":"Technology commercialization"},{"text":"Licensing"},{"text":"Contracts"},{"text":"Business development"},{"text":"Research institutions"},{"text":"Startups and industry"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A Technology Transfer Officer may evaluate an invention, coordinate IP protection, identify commercial partners, negotiate licensing arrangements and support researchers in taking technology from the laboratory toward the market."},{"type":"h","text":"Typical Work"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Evaluate research disclosures"},{"text":"Identify potentially protectable IP"},{"text":"Coordinate patent/trademark/copyright processes"},{"text":"Conduct technology landscape research"},{"text":"Assess commercialization potential"},{"text":"Identify industry partners"},{"text":"Prepare technology profiles"},{"text":"Support licensing negotiations"},{"text":"Draft/review technology-transfer agreements"},{"text":"Manage IP portfolios"},{"text":"Track royalties and contractual obligations"},{"text":"Support startup/spin-off formation"},{"text":"Coordinate researchers, lawyers and industry"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Pathway","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["Class 12","LLB / Integrated Law Degree","IP Law Foundation","Patent + Technology Commercialization Knowledge","IP / Research-Innovation Internship","IP Executive / Technology Transfer Associate","Technology Transfer Officer","Senior Technology Transfer Manager","Technology Commercialization Manager","Head of Technology Transfer / Innovation"]},{"type":"p","text":"An interdisciplinary route can also be valuable:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Law"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Technology / Science Understanding"},{"text":"+"}]},{"type":"flow","items":["Business","Technology Transfer Professional"]}]},{"heading":"Understanding Technology Transfer","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Technology transfer can be viewed as the movement of knowledge or technology from a research environment toward practical use."},{"type":"flow","items":["Research","Discovery / Invention","Invention Disclosure","IP Assessment","Protection","Technology Evaluation","Industry / Startup Identification","Licensing / Collaboration","Development","Commercialization","Market / Societal Impact"]},{"type":"p","text":"The Technology Transfer Officer helps coordinate many of these stages."}]},{"heading":"What You Learn During LLB","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Legal Foundations"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a strong foundation in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Contract law"},{"text":"Legal research"},{"text":"Legal methods"},{"text":"Constitutional law"},{"text":"Tort law"},{"text":"Legal writing"},{"text":"Interpretation of statutes"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Why Contracts Matter"},{"type":"p","text":"Technology transfer frequently involves agreements covering:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Licensing"},{"text":"Confidentiality"},{"text":"Research collaboration"},{"text":"Intellectual property ownership"},{"text":"Royalties"},{"text":"Commercialization"},{"text":"Development obligations"},{"text":"Therefore, contract law is extremely important."}]}]},{"heading":"Year 2 — Intellectual Property Foundation","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Focus strongly on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Patent law"},{"text":"Trademark law"},{"text":"Copyright"},{"text":"Designs"},{"text":"Trade secrets"},{"text":"IP licensing"},{"text":"IP ownership"},{"text":"Assignment"},{"text":"Infringement"},{"text":"Remedies"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Patent Concepts"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Patentable subject matter"},{"text":"Novelty"},{"text":"Inventive step"},{"text":"Industrial applicability"},{"text":"Patent specifications"},{"text":"Claims"},{"text":"Prior-art search"},{"text":"Patent prosecution"},{"text":"Ownership"},{"text":"Assignment"},{"text":"Licensing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A TTO does not need to become a laboratory scientist, but should understand enough technology to communicate effectively with inventors and technical experts."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Commercialization & Technology Management"},{"type":"p","text":"The final stage should develop business-oriented IP skills."},{"type":"h","text":"Focus Areas"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Technology licensing"},{"text":"Commercial contracts"},{"text":"IP valuation fundamentals"},{"text":"Research commercialization"},{"text":"Startup ecosystems"},{"text":"Technology scouting"},{"text":"Industry partnerships"},{"text":"Research collaborations"},{"text":"Technology due diligence"},{"text":"Negotiation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Commercialization Framework"},{"type":"flow","items":["Research Technology","Technical Assessment","IP Assessment","Market Need","Commercial Potential","Industry Search","Partner Evaluation","License / Collaboration","Commercial Development"]}]},{"heading":"Core Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Skill Area","Competencies"],"rows":[[{"text":"IP Law"},{"text":"Patents, trademarks, copyright, designs"}],[{"text":"Contracts"},{"text":"Licensing, assignment, collaboration"}],[{"text":"Technology"},{"text":"Basic understanding of emerging technologies"}],[{"text":"Commercialization"},{"text":"Market and business potential"}],[{"text":"Research"},{"text":"Prior art and technology landscape"}],[{"text":"Negotiation"},{"text":"Licensing and partnership discussions"}],[{"text":"Business"},{"text":"Market, revenue and commercialization models"}],[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Researcher-industry communication"}],[{"text":"Project Management"},{"text":"IP and commercialization pipeline"}],[{"text":"Analytics"},{"text":"Technology/IP portfolio analysis"}],[{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"Agreements, disclosures and reports"}],[{"text":"Networking"},{"text":"Industry and research partnerships"}]]}]},{"heading":"Invention Disclosure","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"One of the first stages of technology transfer is often the invention disclosure."},{"type":"p","text":"Researchers may submit:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Description of invention"},{"text":"Problem solved"},{"text":"Technical solution"},{"text":"Inventors"},{"text":"Experimental results"},{"text":"Potential applications"},{"text":"Existing alternatives"},{"text":"Development stage"},{"text":"The TTO can coordinate the process of evaluating the disclosure."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Researcher","Invention Disclosure","TTO Review","Technical Assessment","IP Assessment","Prior-Art Research","Commercial Assessment","Protection / Development Decision"]}]},{"heading":"Patent & Prior-Art Knowledge","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A technology transfer professional should understand how patent research works."},{"type":"h","text":"Prior-Art Research"},{"type":"p","text":"Look for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Existing patents"},{"text":"Published applications"},{"text":"Scientific papers"},{"text":"Products"},{"text":"Technical publications"},{"text":"Public disclosures"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Research Workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Technology","Identify Technical Features","Search Patent Databases","Search Scientific Literature","Identify Similar Solutions","Compare Claims / Features","Prepare Technology Landscape"]},{"type":"p","text":"A TTO may work with patent professionals or patent agents for specialized patent drafting and prosecution."}]},{"heading":"Technology Assessment","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Not every invention should automatically be commercialized."},{"type":"p","text":"The TTO evaluates factors such as:"},{"type":"h","text":"Technical"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Technology readiness"},{"text":"Proof of concept"},{"text":"Scalability"},{"text":"Development requirements"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Legal"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"IP ownership"},{"text":"Patentability"},{"text":"Freedom-to-operate considerations"},{"text":"Existing licenses"},{"text":"Third-party rights"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Commercial"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Market demand"},{"text":"Competition"},{"text":"Potential customers"},{"text":"Business model"},{"text":"Commercial barriers"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Financial"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Development cost"},{"text":"Licensing potential"},{"text":"Revenue potential"},{"text":"Investment requirement"}]}]},{"heading":"Technology Readiness","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Students should understand the concept of Technology Readiness Levels (TRLs)."},{"type":"p","text":"A simplified pathway:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Basic Research","Proof of Concept","Prototype","Testing","Demonstration","Pilot","Commercial Deployment"]},{"type":"p","text":"The TTO needs to understand that a promising laboratory discovery may still require substantial:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Engineering"},{"text":"Validation"},{"text":"Funding"},{"text":"Regulatory approval"},{"text":"Manufacturing"},{"text":"Market development"},{"text":"before commercialization."}]}]},{"heading":"Licensing","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Licensing is one of the most important TTO activities."},{"text":"A license can give another party specified rights to use IP under agreed terms."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Important Licensing Elements"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Licensed technology"},{"text":"Territory"},{"text":"Field of use"},{"text":"Exclusivity"},{"text":"Duration"},{"text":"Royalties"},{"text":"Upfront fees"},{"text":"Milestones"},{"text":"Sublicensing"},{"text":"Performance obligations"},{"text":"Confidentiality"},{"text":"Improvements"},{"text":"Termination"},{"text":"Reporting"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Licensing Workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Technology","Potential Licensee","Due Diligence","Term Sheet","Negotiation","License Agreement","Execution","Monitoring","Royalty / Milestone Tracking"]}]},{"heading":"Technology Transfer Agreements","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Students should become familiar with agreements such as:"},{"type":"h","text":"NDA"},{"type":"h","text":"Non-Disclosure Agreement"},{"type":"p","text":"Used to protect confidential information during discussions."},{"type":"h","text":"MTA"},{"type":"h","text":"Material Transfer Agreement"},{"type":"p","text":"Used for transfer of biological or research materials under specified conditions."},{"type":"h","text":"Research Agreement"},{"type":"p","text":"Defines collaboration between research organizations and industry."},{"type":"h","text":"IP Assignment"},{"type":"p","text":"Transfers specified IP rights from one party to another."},{"type":"h","text":"License Agreement"},{"type":"p","text":"Grants specified rights to use IP."},{"type":"h","text":"Sponsored Research Agreement"},{"type":"p","text":"Defines funding and research obligations between sponsor and research institution."}]},{"heading":"IP Ownership","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"One of the most important questions in technology transfer is:"},{"type":"p","text":"Who owns the intellectual property?"},{"type":"p","text":"Possible stakeholders can include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Researcher"},{"text":"University"},{"text":"Research institute"},{"text":"Employer"},{"text":"Funding agency"},{"text":"Industry partner"},{"text":"Joint collaborators"},{"text":"Ownership depends on applicable law, institutional policy, employment terms, funding agreements and the specific collaboration."},{"text":"Therefore, a TTO must carefully examine the relevant documents before commercialization."}]}]},{"heading":"Technology Valuation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A technology transfer professional should understand basic IP valuation."},{"type":"h","text":"Factors"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Market size"},{"text":"Technology maturity"},{"text":"Competitive advantage"},{"text":"Patent strength"},{"text":"Development costs"},{"text":"Revenue potential"},{"text":"Licensing potential"},{"text":"Risk"},{"text":"Remaining IP term"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Possible approaches include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cost approach"},{"text":"Market approach"},{"text":"Income approach"},{"text":"The TTO may work with finance, valuation and technical experts rather than independently performing every specialized valuation."}]}]},{"heading":"Industry & Startup Outreach","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Technology transfer is partly a business-development role."},{"type":"p","text":"The officer may identify:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Potential licensees"},{"text":"Strategic partners"},{"text":"Startups"},{"text":"Investors"},{"text":"Manufacturers"},{"text":"Research collaborators"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology-to-Market Workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Technology","Technology Profile","Target Industry","Potential Companies","Outreach","Technical Discussion","Commercial Discussion","Due Diligence","Agreement"]}]},{"heading":"Startup Spin-Offs","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Sometimes a university technology may be better commercialized through a startup rather than direct licensing."},{"type":"flow","items":["Research Discovery","IP Protection","Market Validation","Startup Opportunity","Founding Team","Incubation","Funding","Product Development","Market"]},{"type":"p","text":"A TTO may coordinate with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Incubators"},{"text":"Technology parks"},{"text":"Startup cells"},{"text":"Investors"},{"text":"Researchers"},{"text":"Entrepreneurs"}]}]},{"heading":"Technology Domains","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A TTO may work across many technologies."},{"type":"h","text":"Engineering"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Robotics"},{"text":"Semiconductor technologies"},{"text":"Advanced materials"},{"text":"Manufacturing"},{"text":"Energy"}]},{"type":"h","text":"IT"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Artificial intelligence"},{"text":"Machine learning"},{"text":"Cybersecurity"},{"text":"Software"},{"text":"Cloud technology"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Life Sciences"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Biotechnology"},{"text":"Pharmaceuticals"},{"text":"Medical devices"},{"text":"Diagnostics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Agriculture"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Agri-tech"},{"text":"Food technology"},{"text":"Crop technology"},{"text":"Irrigation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Climate"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Renewable energy"},{"text":"Carbon technologies"},{"text":"Waste management"},{"text":"Sustainability"},{"text":"This makes technology literacy extremely valuable for a law graduate."}]}]},{"heading":"Building Technology Literacy","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A law student does not need to become an engineer, but should be capable of asking meaningful technical questions."},{"type":"p","text":"For example, for an AI invention:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"What problem does it solve?"},{"text":"What is technically novel?"},{"text":"What data is required?"},{"text":"What is the model architecture?"},{"text":"What makes the solution different?"},{"text":"Is the innovation patentable?"},{"text":"Is there proprietary software?"},{"text":"Are third-party datasets involved?"},{"text":"What is the commercialization pathway?"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Ideal Model"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Legal Knowledge"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Technical Literacy"},{"text":"+"}]},{"type":"flow","items":["Business Understanding","Technology Transfer Expertise"]}]},{"heading":"Digital & Analytics Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Essential"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"PowerPoint"},{"text":"Word"},{"text":"Google Workspace"},{"text":"Research databases"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Basic SQL"},{"text":"CRM systems"},{"text":"IP portfolio-management systems"},{"text":"Contract-management systems"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Dashboard Example"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Technology Portfolio"},{"text":"├── Total Disclosures"},{"text":"├── Patents Filed"},{"text":"├── Patents Granted"},{"text":"├── Active Licenses"},{"text":"├── Potential Licensees"},{"text":"├── Technology Readiness"},{"text":"├── Licensing Revenue"},{"text":"└── Commercialization Pipeline"}]}]},{"heading":"AI in Technology Transfer","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"AI can assist TTO teams with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Patent landscape analysis"},{"text":"Technology classification"},{"text":"Prior-art discovery"},{"text":"Document summarization"},{"text":"Licensing-document review"},{"text":"Technology matching"},{"text":"Industry prospect identification"},{"text":"Regulatory research"},{"text":"Portfolio analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"AI-Assisted Technology Matching"},{"type":"flow","items":["Technology","Technical Features","AI-Assisted Classification","Industry Mapping","Potential Companies","Human Due Diligence","Outreach"]},{"type":"p","text":"AI results require human validation, particularly for patentability, ownership, infringement, licensing terms and legal conclusions."}]},{"heading":"Recommended UG Projects","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Technology Transfer Pipeline"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a simulated pipeline:"},{"type":"table","header":["Technology","Domain","TRL","IP Status","Market","Potential Licensee","Status"],"rows":[[{"text":"AI Diagnostic Tool"},{"text":"Healthcare"},{"text":"5"},{"text":"Patent Pending"},{"text":"High"},{"text":"MedTech Firm"},{"text":"Evaluation"}],[{"text":"Solar Material"},{"text":"Energy"},{"text":"4"},{"text":"Patent Filed"},{"text":"High"},{"text":"Energy Company"},{"text":"Outreach"}],[{"text":"Agri Sensor"},{"text":"AgriTech"},{"text":"6"},{"text":"Protected"},{"text":"Medium"},{"text":"AgriTech Startup"},{"text":"Negotiation"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Patent Landscape"},{"type":"p","text":"Choose a technology such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"EV batteries"},{"text":"AI diagnostics"},{"text":"Agricultural drones"},{"text":"Renewable energy"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Map:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Major patents"},{"text":"Technology trends"},{"text":"Major companies"},{"text":"Research institutions"},{"text":"Potential gaps"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Technology Commercialization Report"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a report containing:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Technology","Problem","Solution","IP","TRL","Market","Competition","Business Model","Potential Partners","Commercialization Strategy"]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Sample Licensing Agreement Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyze a hypothetical license agreement and identify:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"IP rights"},{"text":"Territory"},{"text":"Exclusivity"},{"text":"Royalties"},{"text":"Milestones"},{"text":"Confidentiality"},{"text":"Termination"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — University Startup Case Study"},{"type":"p","text":"Select a real university-originated technology commercialization example and study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Research origin"},{"text":"IP"},{"text":"Commercialization strategy"},{"text":"Industry partner"},{"text":"Funding"},{"text":"Market application"}]}]},{"heading":"Internship Strategy","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Priority 1 — University Technology Transfer Office"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Invention disclosures"},{"text":"IP management"},{"text":"Licensing"},{"text":"Researcher interaction"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Priority 2 — Research Institution"},{"type":"p","text":"Gain exposure to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Research commercialization"},{"text":"Patent portfolios"},{"text":"Industry collaboration"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Priority 3 — IP Law Firm"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Patent law"},{"text":"Licensing"},{"text":"IP transactions"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Priority 4 — Startup Incubator"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Startup formation"},{"text":"IP strategy"},{"text":"Technology commercialization"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Priority 5 — Corporate R&D / Innovation Team"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Industry research"},{"text":"Technology scouting"},{"text":"Licensing"},{"text":"Strategic partnerships"}]}]},{"heading":"Employer Skill Matrix","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Employer","Valuable Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"University TTO"},{"text":"IP + research commercialization"}],[{"text":"Research Institute"},{"text":"Patent + technology evaluation"}],[{"text":"IP Law Firm"},{"text":"IP law + licensing"}],[{"text":"Corporate R&D"},{"text":"Technology scouting + contracts"}],[{"text":"Startup Incubator"},{"text":"IP + entrepreneurship"}],[{"text":"Innovation Consultancy"},{"text":"Technology assessment"}],[{"text":"Government Research Organization"},{"text":"IP + research administration"}],[{"text":"Biotech/Pharma"},{"text":"Life-science IP + licensing"}],[{"text":"Technology Company"},{"text":"Software/AI IP + commercial contracts"}]]}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Additional Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Useful areas include:"},{"type":"h","text":"IP"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Patent law"},{"text":"Trademark law"},{"text":"Licensing"},{"text":"IP management"},{"text":"Technology commercialization"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Business"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Entrepreneurship"},{"text":"Business development"},{"text":"Market research"},{"text":"Negotiation"},{"text":"Valuation fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI fundamentals"},{"text":"Biotechnology fundamentals"},{"text":"Electronics fundamentals"},{"text":"Emerging technology trends"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional Development"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Contract drafting"},{"text":"Technology scouting"},{"text":"Research commercialization"},{"text":"Project management"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest profile combines formal legal education with practical IP/commercialization experience, rather than relying on certificates alone."}]},{"heading":"PG Options","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Law"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"LL.M. Intellectual Property Rights"},{"text":"LL.M. Technology Law"},{"text":"LL.M. Business/Commercial Law"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology & Business"},{"type":"p","text":"Depending on eligibility:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MBA"},{"text":"MBA Technology Management"},{"text":"Innovation Management"},{"text":"Entrepreneurship"},{"text":"Technology Management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Specialized"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Biotechnology Law"},{"text":"Cyber Law"},{"text":"Data & Technology Law"},{"text":"Patent & Innovation Management"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Specializations","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Technology Transfer Officer can specialize in:"},{"type":"h","text":"1. University Technology Transfer"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Academic research"},{"text":"Invention disclosures"},{"text":"Licensing"},{"text":"Spin-offs"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2. Patent Licensing"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Patent portfolios"},{"text":"Licensing negotiations"},{"text":"Royalty management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Life Sciences Technology Transfer"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Biotechnology"},{"text":"Pharmaceuticals"},{"text":"Medical devices"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4. AI & Software Commercialization"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI"},{"text":"Software"},{"text":"Data"},{"text":"Digital technologies"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. Industry Technology Scouting"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Finding external technologies"},{"text":"Partnerships"},{"text":"Acquisitions"},{"text":"Licensing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"6. Innovation Management"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Research portfolio"},{"text":"Commercialization strategy"},{"text":"Startup ecosystem"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["IP / Innovation Intern","Technology Transfer Associate","Technology Transfer Officer","Senior Technology Transfer Officer","Technology Commercialization Manager","Senior Manager / Director","Head of Technology Transfer","Head of Innovation / Commercialization"]},{"type":"p","text":"Alternative legal pathway:"},{"type":"flow","items":["LLB","IP Law","Licensing","Technology Transactions","IP / Technology Counsel","Technology Commercialization Leadership"]}]},{"heading":"Target Profile at Graduation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A strong LLB g